    text+='</tbody></table></div>'
    text+=pair('拒绝原因可以重叠，因此不把各行相加来求32条lane。硬限位18表示硬关节限位违规，不是18对几何重叠。接触标量30是记录数值的阈值拒绝；独立SDK刷新时刻未证实，不能称为30条新鲜接触力失败，更不能由保持目标变化为0推导实际驱动峰值安全。','Reasons overlap, so their counts are not summed to recover32 lanes. The hard-limit count18 means joint-limit violations, not18 geometric overlaps. The30 scalar denials concern recorded values; independent SDK refresh epochs are unverified. They do not establish30 fresh-contact-force failures, and zero held-target changes establish no safe actual drive peak.')
    text+='<div id="r16Protocol"></div>'
    text+=pair('<h3>方法与实验设置</h3>沿用同32候选、74维状态/速度/目标、原12步挑战与相机选择规则。四个固定8-lane分区完成独立初始像素及已提交行0/1的数值核对，合并结果覆盖全部32lane。原8192与补充32768模型分母分别保留；累计40960仅为模型预测。','<h3>Methods and experimental setting</h3> The same32 candidates retain their74-dimensional states, velocities and targets, original12-step challenge and camera selection rules. Four fixed8-lane partitions independently checked initial pixels and committed numerical rows0/1; their merged result covers all32 lanes. The original8192 and supplemental32768 model denominators remain separate;40960 is MODEL_ONLY.','div')
    text+='<div id="r16Criteria"></div>'
    text+=pair('<h3>初始覆盖判据</h3>每条lane保留四只手各三视图和三张广角，共15张。手部覆盖逐项联系掌部、五指与所有原生手部body；三视图角度分离与原27项保持状态核对沿用原门槛。广角覆盖分别核对四臂与两桌，各至少1024像素；每个关键forearm/wrist2 body在三张已选广角中的像素峰值至少为128。初始覆盖通过不替代最终、警报时点或完整物理挑战。','<h3>Initial coverage criteria</h3> Each lane retains three views for each of four hands plus three wide views:15 originals. Coverage links the palm, five fingers and all native hand bodies, with the original angular separation and27-field held-state checks. Wide coverage checks each of four arms and two tables at1024 pixels; each critical forearm/wrist2 body requires a peak of at least 128 pixels across the three selected wide views. Initial coverage does not replace final/alarm coverage or the full physical challenge.','div')
    text+='<div id="r16FailureCases"></div>'
    text+=pair('<h3>失败分析与限制</h3>本轮仍在原1200秒边界终止，没有完整挑战及最终相机。独立数值核对给出首步拒绝，不是完整物理推进或安全峰值证明。9021球代理不是完整mesh，接触刷新、驱动峰值、微步内峰值、力矩/坐标系与全局误差界仍未知。任务未运行，正式留出未开启。','<h3>Failure analysis and limitations</h3> The run still ended at its original1200-second boundary without the full challenge or final cameras. Independent numerical checks establish first-step denials, not full physical advance or a certified safety peak. The9021 sphere proxy is not a complete mesh. Contact refresh, drive peaks, within-step peaks, wrench/frame meaning and global error bounds remain unknown. Tasks remain unrun and formal holdout unopened.','div')
    text+=pair('已关闭的HOST诊断中，构造函数边界99.664621秒并正常返回。它包含嵌套调用及观测开销，不能相加，不是GPU时间、纯I/O时间、运行提速或根因修复证书。','In the closed HOST diagnostic, the constructor boundary lasted99.664621 seconds and returned. Nested calls and observation overhead are included; spans must not be added. This is neither GPU time, pure I/O time, native speedup nor a root-cause-fix certificate.')
    text+='<div id="r16PerTrialEvidence"></div><h3>32组当前原图与逐lane覆盖 / Current originals and per-lane coverage</h3>'
    text+=pair('每组页面列出本次global ID、初始时点、15张1280×720原图及对应覆盖结论。全量480张按组查看，首页不一次加载全部图像。相机初始覆盖通过与首步数值拒绝同时保留，不能把画面清楚当成物理安全。','Each group page identifies the current global ID and initial phase,15 original1280×720 images and their coverage evidence. Browse all480 by group; the overview does not load them all. Initial camera acceptance and first-step numerical denial are both retained. Clear images do not establish physical safety.')
    text+='<ul class="r16-gallery-links">'
    for g in f['gallery_groups']:
        text+=f'<li><a href="{prefix}/gallery/env_{g["lane"]:03d}.html">lane {g["lane"]} · global {g["candidate"]["global_id"]} · INITIAL · 15</a></li>'
    text+='</ul>'
    for lane in (0,31):
        g=f['gallery_groups'][lane];im=next(x for x in g['images'] if x['role']=='wide' and x['view']==1)
        text+=f'<figure><img loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" src="{prefix}/{im["relative"]}" alt="V13 lane{lane} INITIAL wide selected1"><figcaption>'+pair(f'lane {lane} / global {g["candidate"]["global_id"]} 的本轮初始广角1。仅代表初始覆盖；首步数值拒绝，完整安全尚未通过。',f'Current initial wide view1 for lane{lane} / global{g["candidate"]["global_id"]}. Initial coverage only; first-step numerical denial, full safety unaccepted.')+'</figcaption></figure>'
    text+='</div><details id="r16EvidenceAppendix"><summary>证据与复现 / Evidence and reproduction</summary><div id="r16Reproduction"></div>'
    text+=pair('当前DATA十项科学语义独立复核及主级采纳均已闭合；本报告候选仍待独立科学映射复核，不自授报告科学PASS或发布许可。V10历史图像与判定仍只属于V10。','The distinct ten-check DATA semantic review and parent adoption are closed. This report candidate still awaits a distinct scientific mapping review and grants itself no report science PASS or publication authority. V10 historical images and verdicts remain scoped to V10.')
    text+='<p>Native −9/raw9; CPU0, outer/tool1; rows0/1 only, missing2..12 and final; ENTRY/PRODUCER/ProfileClose absent. Original27 mandatory; latest42 UNKNOWN_UNBOUND, not an adopted new requirement. Receipts-only2/2/2 is separate from INITIAL/rows01 DATA. Historical71948 tool terminal UNKNOWN_PERMANENT is retained.</p><p>Original byte-copy and header/SHA checks are report preparation, not a new mask/numerical audit. No crop, resizing or generated camera images. Source/ownership receipts remain in this appendix.</p><ul>'
    for k in ('V13_parent','V13_DATA_handoff','V13_DATA_report','V13_DATA_compact','V13_selected_ledger','V13_selected_parent_intake','V13_DATA_parent_intake','V13_HOST_diagnostic'):
        q=f['source_refs'][k];text+=f'<li><a href="{prefix}/evidence/{k}.json">{e(k)}</a> · <code>{q["sha256"]}</code></li>'
    text+=f'''</ul><p><a href="{prefix}/SELECTED_CURRENT_V13_ORIGINAL_INVENTORY_V1.json">Current480 selection and exact SHA</a> · <a href="{prefix}/COMMITTED_2X32_NUMERIC_V1.csv">Committed0/1 per-lane numerical records</a> · <a href="{prefix}/FACTS_INCREMENT16_V1.json">Frozen LOCAL facts</a> · <a href="{prefix}/source/SOURCE_GRAPH_V1.json">Reproducible source</a> · <a href="{prefix}/archive_report15/index.html" download>报告15原始HTML（下载）/ Report15 raw HTML download</a> · <a href="#nativeAttemptIncrement15">查看历史报告15 / View historical Report15</a></p><p id="r16PendingBoundary">INITIAL32 DATA checked; distinct DATA semantic peer PASS_DATA_ONLY_PARTIAL_SCOPE; distinct REPORT16 science peer PENDING; PUBLICATION NOT_PERFORMED.</p></details></div></section>'''
