def gallery_page(g,prefix):
    e=html.escape;lane=g['lane'];global_id=g['candidate']['global_id']
    head=f'''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>V13 INITIAL lane{lane} · global{global_id}</title><style>body{{max-width:1100px;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem;font:16px/1.65 system-ui;overflow-wrap:anywhere}}img{{width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain}}figure{{margin:1.5rem 0;min-width:0}}pre{{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;max-width:100%}}code{{word-break:break-all}}details{{padding:1rem;background:#f1f5f6}}figcaption{{font-size:.9rem}}</style><a href="../../index.html#nativeAttemptIncrement16">报告16 / Report16</a><h1>V13 · lane{lane} · global{global_id} · INITIAL</h1><p>本轮初始像素覆盖已独立核对，首步数值拒绝，完整12步与物理安全未通过。Current initial pixel coverage independently checked; first-step numerical denial; full12 and physical safety unaccepted.</p><p>15 original1280×720 views. CSS display only; original image bytes unchanged. Related same32, not15 new IID samples.</p><details><summary>逐lane覆盖与原始选择证据 / Per-lane coverage and original selection evidence</summary><pre>{e(json.dumps(dict(candidate=g['candidate'],state=g['state'],coverage=g['coverage']),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))}</pre></details>'''
    for im in g['images']:
        head+=f'''<figure data-role="{im['role']}" data-view="{im['view']}"><img loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" src="../{im['relative']}" alt="V13 INITIAL lane{lane} {im['role']} selected{im['view']}"><figcaption>{im['role']} · selected {im['view']} · INITIAL only / 仅初始覆盖，不是完整安全验收。<details><summary>Original SHA and metadata</summary><code>{im['original']['sha256']}</code><pre>{e(json.dumps(dict(original=im['original'],attempt=im['attempt'],actual_lane_audit=im['actual_lane_audit'],original_evidence=im['original_evidence']),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))}</pre></details></figcaption></figure>'''
    return head+'</html>'
